<title>UK: FTSE Ex-dividend data delayed.</title>
<headline>FTSE Ex-dividend data delayed.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The list of FTSE 100 companies going ex-dividend on Monday has been delayed by technical problems.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
